00:17:14,270 --> 00:17:17,610
因为你极度鄙视我的魔术
Well, since you find my magic tricks so embarrassing,

320
00:17:17,860 --> 00:17:22,110
我想知道你小时候有什么酷爱好
I got to wondering what cool hobbies you had as a kid.

321
00:17:24,490 --> 00:17:25,700
她说了什么
What'd she say?

322
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:28,620
你妈没说什么
She didn't say much of anything.

323
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:31,830
但她说了很多
But she said a lot!

324
00:17:33,870 --> 00:17:36,130
伯纳黛特  还记得我吗
Hi, Bernadette, remember me?

325
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:40,840
首先  她不是这种口音
First of all, that's not what she sounds like,

326
00:17:41,010 --> 00:17:43,170
人家来自南卡罗来纳州
she's from South Carolina.

327
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:46,970
真不敢相信你嘲笑了我这么多年
I can't believe you made fun of me all these years

328
00:17:47,140 --> 00:17:49,970
你自己却是个深柜腹语者
while you were a closeted ventriloquist.

329
00:17:51,100 --> 00:17:54,310
不是我自愿想成为腹语者
Okay, it's not like I wanted to be a ventriloquist.

330
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:56,730
我当时参加选美  我需要一项才艺
I was in beauty pageants and I needed a talent

331
00:17:56,900 --> 00:17:59,690
不能光靠散播谣言  说其他参赛者怀孕了
besides spreading rumors that the other contestants were pregnant.

332
00:18:01,190 --> 00:18:04,030
既然你很享受扔掉我的东西
Well, since you enjoyed getting rid of all my stuff,

333
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:06,700
也许我们应该把这位小姑娘扔进碎木机
maybe we should throw this little lady in the wood chipper.

334
00:18:06,860 --> 00:18:09,700
不  这位小姑娘有名字的
No! And the little lady has a name.

335
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:11,700
叫什么
Which is?

336
00:18:13,700 --> 00:18:15,830
黛咪·乔·圣·克劳
Tammy Jo St. Cloud.

337
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:20,250
"黛咪·乔·圣·克劳"
"Tammy Jo St. Cloud."

338
00:18:20,500 --> 00:18:22,050
而我玩抛接球就被笑是死宅
Oh, and I'm a dork for juggling.

339
00:18:23,010 --> 00:18:24,720
对不起  你不是死宅男
Sorry, you're not a dork.

340
00:18:25,550 --> 00:18:26,880
你是小丑
You're a clown.

341
00:18:28,890 --> 00:18:31,760
黛咪·乔  别这样说  他会感到难受的
Tammy Jo, don't say that, you'll make him feel bad.

342
00:18:32,220 --> 00:18:35,350
看他  他有哪点可以自我感觉良好
Look at him, what reason he got to feel good?

343
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:39,060
好了  非常好笑
All right, very funny.

344
00:18:39,230 --> 00:18:42,020
别听她的  她被关在盒子里25年了
Don't listen to her, she's been in a box for, like, 25 years.

345
00:18:42,730 --> 00:18:45,530
对  我被关之前他的发型还很流行呢
Yeah, back when his haircut was fashionable.

346
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:49,950
够了  把她拿开
That's enough, put her away.

347
00:18:50,410 --> 00:18:52,870
老爹爹  你想得美
Oh, big daddy, I don't think so.

348
00:18:53,040 --> 00:18:55,580
你娶了妮妮小姐  就是娶了我
You marry Miss Bernie, you marry me.

349
00:18:56,750 --> 00:18:58,580
我们现在是一家人了
We all family now.

350
00:19:01,250 --> 00:19:02,590
好了  你吓着我了
All right, you're freaking me out.

351
00:19:02,880 --> 00:19:03,920
别这样
Don't be that way.

352
00:19:04,090 --> 00:19:07,800
只要你不介意少许的木片毛刺  咱们就一妻一妾这样过吧
If you don't mind a few splinters, we can have us a menage a trois.

353
00:19:16,850 --> 00:19:20,560
我成功了  我成功了

I'm doing it. I'm doing it.

354
00:19:21,190 --> 00:19:23,360
我好高  我成功了
I'm tall and I'm doing it!

355
00:19:28,150 --> 00:19:29,610
真扫兴
Ah, man.

